  "instance_name": "deaf_community_secrecy_stereotype",
  "label": "Deaf Community Secrecy Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme plays on the trope that members of a club or group are secretive about their existence or rules, often humorously referred to as 'the first rule of [club name]... you do not talk about [club name]'. This trope is used here to imply that deaf people are secretive about their community, which is a harmful stereotype as it misrepresents the openness and visibility of the deaf community.",
